@startuml monster_type

package entity.type {
  interface EntityType {
    + typeId(): int
    + name(): String
    + isHostileToPlayer(): boolean
    + canRespawn(): boolean
  }

  class MonsterType <<record>> {
    + typeId(): int
    + name(): String
  }
}

MonsterType ..|> EntityType

note right of EntityType
**Notes**
- シールドインターフェース: PlayerType, NpcType, MonsterType, ChickenType,
- SwordType, AxeType, ShieldType, RedPotionType, GreenPotionType,
- BluePotionType, PickupOnlyType, BombType, BossMonsterType, ChestType,
- PotType, RockType のみが EntityType を実装できる。
- デフォルトメソッド: isHostileToPlayer() と canRespawn() は true を返す。

- Sealed interface: Only PlayerType, NpcType, MonsterType, ChickenType,
- SwordType, AxeType, ShieldType, RedPotionType, GreenPotionType,
- BluePotionType, PickupOnlyType, BombType, BossMonsterType, ChestType,
- PotType, and RockType may implement EntityType.
- Default methods: isHostileToPlayer() and canRespawn() return true by default.
end note

@enduml